[32m+[m[32m## Model Architecture[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Model:** EfficientNet-B0[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Approach:** Transfer learning[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Number of classes:** 50[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Training strategy:** Frozen-backbone baseline with regularized training[m
[32m+[m[32m- **Framework:** PyTorch and Torchvision[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Dataset[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe model was developed using a selected subset of Google Landmarks v2 metadata and landmark images collected for the project.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe final dataset contains approximately 955 images across 50 landmark classes.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mThe dataset was divided into training, validation, and test sets using a reproducible split with random seed 42.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mDataset files and trained model checkpoints are excluded from Git and must be obtained separately.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m## Model Evaluation[m
