[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m| Metric | Result |[m
[32m+[m[32m|---|---:|[m
[32m+[m[32m| Test images | 142 |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Landmark classes | 50 |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Top-1 accuracy | 45.07% |[m
[32m+[m[32m| Top-5 accuracy | 72.54% |[m
